<title>GERMANY: D.Telekom withdraws Retevision bid.</title>
<headline>D.Telekom withdraws Retevision bid.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telekom AG said on Tuesday it had withdrawn as a member of the group bidding for Spanish fixed-network operator Retevision, and that the group would be led by France Telecom.</p>
<p>Telekom would maintain an option for a later entry, chairman Ron Sommer said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
